{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_handoff", "label": "Session 82 Combined Handoff", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_f811", "label": "f811.py (Structural Ladder Detector and Forward Lint Gate)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A structural detector - re-seed plus energy accumulation - never lexical, scanning 486 .py files. From s82 onward 'f811.py lint PATH' binds every instrument."}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_conf82", "label": "conf82.py (Converged-Field Node Census)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_doubt82", "label": "doubt82.py (Doubt-Sited Control Harness)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_restart_offset_vocabulary", "label": "The Restart Offset: Corrected Vocabulary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The quantity is a SIGNED restart offset; its magnitude is a RESOLUTION. It is not a drop, not a descent, and not a distance to a basin floor. Nineteen files say 'ladder' in four different senses and only three mean the one F81.1 was about."}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_r82_1_positive_control", "label": "R82.1 - The Positive Control", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Any detector that scans the corpus must include among its can-fails at least one REAL corpus file whose verdict is established by inspection and written down BEFORE the detector runs, in both directions, and it gates. Synthetic can-fails all passed while the detector was wrong in both directions at once."}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_r82_2_doubt_sited_control", "label": "R82.2 - The Doubt-Sited Control", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A control must be sited where the instrument is DOUBTED, not where it is trusted; halt at rc=5 if no such control can be built, because the impossibility is itself the finding. A doubt-sited control may fail, which restricts the claim rather than voiding it - only not looking is forbidden."}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_f82_1", "label": "F82.1 The Fault Detector Could Not See the Fault (Three Drafts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_f82_2", "label": "F82.2 The Matching Criterion Cannot See a Rydberg Channel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "log(nrm) crosses zero exactly once in the whole l=2 channel, so every channel shallower than the valence eigenvalue is invisible BY CONSTRUCTION and s81's 80x widening could never have worked. Unseen for three sessions because the control was always 6d - sited in the one region where the instrument works. Severity is bounded by argument: the hidden channels are least bound in their l and can never be an entrant."}, {"id": "recovered_session_82_combined_node_census", "label": "The Node Census: The States Are There, the Zeros Are Not", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "nd climbs 3 to 16 monotone with nothing skipped; the 4-node region spans 86 scan points and the 5-node region 66, yet neither yields a zero. All three filed explanations were killed by measurement."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_session_82_combined_handoff", "target": "recovered_session_81_combined_handoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_82_combined_handoff", "target": "recovered_session_82_combined_f811", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_82_combined_handoff", "target": "recovered_session_82_combined_conf82", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_82_combined_handoff", "target": "recovered_session_82_combined_doubt82", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_82_combined_f811", "target": "recovered_session_81_combined_f81_1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-82-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_sessio